Subject: [PATCH 30/54] feat: bots leading a battleground raid pass the lead to
 a GM or guildmate

Opt-in via Playerbots.BgGiveLeaderToPlayer (default 0), so a real player can
set raid groups and give orders.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vn4vD1fiBmsMGCCvsiqU7z
